<title>DUBAI: Kuwait cuts May LPG prices - KPC.</title>
<headline>Kuwait cuts May LPG prices - KPC.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait Petroleum Corp (KPC) has set its May liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) prices at $192 a tonne for butane and $179 a tonne for propane, KPC said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The move again matches Saudi Aramco's decision to cut its butane prices by $15 a tonne and propane by $19 a tonne.</p>
</text>
